# React components (analytics.admin)

Declare every React component as a default function export. Do not use named function exports, `const` components, or `export default` of an anonymous arrow.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
export function BadgePage() {
  return null
}

const BadgePage = () => null
export default BadgePage

// ✅ GOOD
export default function BadgePage() {
  return null
}
```

Barrel `index.ts` re-exports the default:

```ts
export { default } from './BadgePage'
```

Import the default from the folder:

```ts
import BadgePage from '@/pages/BadgePage'
```

Does not apply to non-components (`router.ts`, hooks, route `Route` objects, type-only modules).
